flowchart LR
  subgraph Interfaces[Office interfaces]
    Desk[Hawa Desk\ncanonical]
    TG[Telegram Bot + Mini App]
    WA[WAHA / dedicated account\noptional]
    Other[Other adapters]
  end
  Desk --> Ingress[Verified ingress\nPostgreSQL inbox/outbox]
  TG --> Ingress
  WA --> Ingress
  Other --> Ingress
  Ingress --> DB[(PostgreSQL 18\nClient DNA + operations + pgvector)]
  Ingress --> Restate[Restate durable workflow]
  Restate --> Router[Deterministic routing + typed AI]
  Router --> Memory[Hybrid client-scoped retrieval]
  Memory --> Creative[Creative Director]
  Creative --> Assets[ComfyUI + direct image adapters]
  Assets --> Studio[DesignStudioAdapter]
  Studio --> Hy[HyCanvas v0.3.9 candidate]
  Studio -. fallback .-> Fall[Penpot / focused editor / Chromium]
  Hy --> QA[Hard QA + independent visual judge]
  Fall --> QA
  QA --> Review[Human review in Hawa Desk]
  Review -->|revise| Restate
  Review -->|approve exact revision| Publish[Idempotent publisher]
  Publish --> Drive[Google Shared Drive]
  Publish --> Sheets[Google Sheets mirror]
  Review --> Feedback[Feedback ledger + governed rules]
  Feedback --> DB
  Restate -. OpenTelemetry .-> Phoenix[Self-hosted Phoenix]
